{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>In the latter days.</b> At the end of days, with the coming of the redeemer — when the latter days of the enemy nations and their kingdom will have arrived, such that their measure reaches its full completion, as it says: כִּי אֶעֱשֶׂה כָלָה (Jeremiah 46:28). So too Balaam spoke, saying: בְּאַחֲרִית הַיָּמִים (Numbers 24:14), as he testified in saying: וְקַרְקַר כָּל בְּנֵי שֵׁת (Numbers 24:17). And likewise the prophets in saying: וְהָיָה בְּאַחֲרִית הַיָּמִים יִהְיֶה הַר בֵּית ה' נָכוֹן בְּרֹאשׁ הֶהָרִים (Micah 4:1). This is what Jacob declared here in saying: <b>until Shiloh come, and to him shall the obedience of the peoples be, binding his foal to the vine</b>, etc."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:35:15.488946337Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}